# Sweep the camera left then right (3 s each, right stick at half tilt), then let go. Ends near where it
# started, so repeated runs don't pin the camera against the alley walls (a one-way 6 s orbit did, 2026-11-10).
# For burst captures at Unlocked, where the render thread adds in-between frames while something moves.
200 -
3000 - 0 0 -0.5 0   # right stick half left
3000 - 0 0 0.5 0    # right stick half right
500 -
